sequenceDiagram
    participant Chk as :feature:checkout
    participant Core as :core:data / :core:model (contract)
    participant App as :app (navigation host)
    participant Cat as :feature:catalog

    Chk->>Core: use shared contract (model/interface) - NOT catalog internals
    Chk->>App: navigate to product route (Ch 97) - app wired the graph
    App->>Cat: resolve route -> catalog screen
    Note over Chk,Cat: features never import each other - app composes them, core shares contracts
